Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the\Nsea Raising our voices We
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,take in the beautiful blue\Nworld Our spirits ready to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,go Everybody rejoices Now\Nlet's go Get the sails all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for adventure. We're\Nitching to try. Get ready to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Roll. So all aboard now. We're\Nset to go. Set sail to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,ocean so deep Ready for a\Ntruly grand adventure Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think That sounds really\Nfun All this excitement Second to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,none As we all travel across the sea\NRaising our voices We take in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful blue world Our spirits ready\Nto go Everybody rejoices Now let's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,go Get the cells all unfurled La la
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah If there's something\Nthat I just won't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever forget. It's the way that I felt when
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,our journey was set Now\NI won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.66,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou now, fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Lola!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, you need to come\Nonto the deck quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen the sun in two years\Nsince Merde has stole our shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, Captain. But look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.31,0:03:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it's the same for you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We got our shadows back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Every member of the crew\Nhad their shadows returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think this means someone out\Nthere was able to beat Gecko Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, that's bloody likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even before Moria became a warlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he went toe-to-toe with Kaido\Nof the four pirate emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think someone came along\Nand was able to bring him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels so good to see the sun again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but our zombies\Nat Thriller Park must have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Patty, this curse has finally been lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can stand out the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our shadows back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss\Nabout margarita my shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,my shadow has returned after all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,what It just returned\Nyou said a pirate stole
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:05:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it 10 years ago but\Nnow it's back it's true
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Master i'm so sorry i was so surprised when\Ni saw it i dropped your cherished plates
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hated plates for a\Nlong time now, but all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,of a sudden i seem to\Nhave gotten over all that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to be so much\Ntrouble. I'll pack my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,things and leave the\Nmansion right away Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about those silly old plates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is\Nyou weren't hurt, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you have your shadow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so happy for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness that's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it wasn't my day to die after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was on my way to\Nheaven for a moment there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be like heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Two times over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You jackasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Half your bodies were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We Thought you were all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That was scary. Yeah. It's sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to be Afraid of it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our shadows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our days of hiding in the\Ndark are finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like everybody survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The sunlight had definitely\Nbegun to erase our existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But our shadows returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,changing our bodies to their fully\Nrecovered state just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That would follow the same\Nlogic as when we saw Moria
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,change the shape of Ours\Nby manipulating his shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My theory is that the\Nshadow must know what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,shape its owner is supposed\Nto be or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell if I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But relax, now that we beat Moria,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we'll\Never have to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,our shadows being stolen\Naway from us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and that no one or their shadow\Nended up disappearing for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you guys, but\Nall that fighting wore me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Has anybody got any cola?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All the creepy crap and weird creatures\Nin this place were an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A false reality made\Nby Moria and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he's been beaten, there's\Nnothing left in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we all woke up from\Nthe same horrible nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and I for one I'm Sure as
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,hell glad it's over hey hey
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom wake up wake up\Ndamn it hey come on wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,would
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you calm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,down her shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,already left her body dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hogback?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here,\Nand what happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.14,0:08:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell should I\Nknow what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably got your ass kicked\Nin some embarrassing manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't here, but anyway, something\Nawful has happened to Master Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Meat has been defeated\Nby Straw Hat Loopy! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too damn loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your inside voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your inside voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pissed because Thriller\NBark is useless to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no intention of living out\Nthe rest of my life as a washed-up loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy got small again a second ago, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me that when he uses third gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,his body shrinks for a\Nwhile as a side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These new fighting techniques seem\Nlike too much for his body to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He could actually hurt himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really starting to worry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Every enemy we run into is stronger\Nthan the last one we faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna have to keep doing\Nthis to himself every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to pull ourselves\Ntogether, and soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, it's a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them kept their shadows\Neven after we beat Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just an old man\Nwith serious injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too damn confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just be a zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you that old geezer\Nwe met in the cemetery?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable to\Nthink that we'd see the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,day when we'd be able to\Nwalk under the sun again
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how we\Ncan ever repay you Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, spoil!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the honorary chairman\Nof the Victims Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all okay, then?\NYes. And you? Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess they all know\Neach other or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. You're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we didn't thank you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really grateful to\Nevery last one of you folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we got you all\Nwrapped up in our mess here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we knew it when we first saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You were our only hope against Moria\Nand that damn curse he put on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So thank you all very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,From me and all the members of\Nthe Thriller Bark Victims Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never forget that\Nwe owe you our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you from the bottom of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever need anything,\Nplease let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We may not have much, but all\Nwe have is yours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And lastly, and most importantly, I\Nwill allow one of you to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's really no need for\Nall this thank you stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Luffy told the\Nold man when we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We were fighting for our own\Ncrew and on our own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the lucky guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you guys were\Nrescued too is just a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone was finally showing\Nus a little gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us thank you all proper-like, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys might not have\Nset out to save us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're still glad you\Nsent Merde a packing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I forgot something\Nreally important. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still another warlord on\Nthe island. Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, this is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My greatest fears have become\Nan unfortunate reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm and listen. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,During the fight with\NMoria and the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another one of them on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the seven warlords of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,one of...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The seven warlords of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course all of this happens just when we\Nfinally chose a successor for Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing another warlord in such\Na short time sets a bad example.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell if he's still\Nbreathing, even in the slightest? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If he is in fact still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we will wait for his\Nrecovery and hope he can
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,maintain his position as\None of the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We will follow up after such time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The dignity of the\NWarlords would be tarnished
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,if we were to keep losing them so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It is critical that this\Nnews not reach anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,These damn Straw Hats are such a ducence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who stands just as tall as Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate known throughout\Nthe world as the Tyrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma. On away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.04,0:13:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Tyrant Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel I've made my orders\Nquite clear on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot afford to let anyone\Nelse know of Moria's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a direct order\Nfrom the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Obliterate the Straw Hat crew and\Neveryone else on Thriller Bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave no one alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did he just say\Nwhat I think he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna obliterate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanna kill all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this cannot be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We just managed to get all our shadows\Nback from Moria, and now this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of these warlords\Ndo we have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He has some strange abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him make someone disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With only a touch of his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean like Pooh but\Nthey're suddenly gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And he can move from one location\Nto another in a split second!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.26,0:15:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he do that? Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And just when we got our freedom back too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm going\Ndown now without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're just gonna roll over and\Ndie after all the crap we've been through?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You got another thing coming, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take him down! You heard him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's do or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's way too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the ones he didn't touch, it's almost\Nlike something shot right through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter Zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I begin the annihilation with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on hang in there\Nlittle buddy don't you die
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,on me what the hell did\Nthat bastard just pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked him out without laying a finger
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,on him what kind of\Npowers does this guy have?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of sick twist\Nof fate is this all these
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,years we've spent hiding\Nin that dark forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffering beneath Merde is tyranny\Nand just when the nightmare seems
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,like it's over another one of The\Nseven warlords shows up and says
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,he's going to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.89,0:16:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,annihilate us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,guy's got no sense of honor He
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,knows the battle they just went\Nthrough and what kind of shape they're
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In, he's just kicking them when\Nthey're down. Screw the odds, we may
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,not have their powers but we can\Nstill fight So you're gonna have to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,deal with us, yeah. Who cares if you're\None of the seven warlords? You're
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing compared to oars and Merde\Ndrop the big talk and stay back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one he called out\Nyou heard it as well as i did
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give him the fight he wants. You want\Nto talk about honor, then don't butt in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew's developed quite the popular\Nreputation, among scum, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that some of the tales\Nof your crew are true, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear Straw Hat Luffy has staffed\Nhis ship with rather skilled underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no, stop it, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush at you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hardly the time\Nto be flattered, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave a trail of trouble\Nin your wake everywhere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The infamy isn't reserved\Nfor your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You each bear your own\Nshare of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's madness with the\Nstate that you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bones have got to be\Nnothing but dust at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When disaster stares you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've either got to step up or\Njust get the hell out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer the former, making\Nexcuses won't delay catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die here and now, that's\Nas far as I was meant to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style, draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Rossimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.58,0:18:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, this guy's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Kuma didn't even touch\Nhim and his breathing's all ragged!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his power?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even figure out what he's doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are those weird\Nmarks left on the rubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His hand—what's that on his\Npaw? Are those are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,paw pads that's crazy why\Nwould a human have paw pads
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.34,0:19:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,36 caliber
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,phoenix look
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Out he deflected Zoro's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,attack with his bare hands\Nhow is that even Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I just figured\Nout what your ability is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess the power to\Ndeflect anything I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I ate the pawpaw fruit\Nand became a pawpawmed human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, pawpawmed human?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he say that with a straight face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the most ridiculous\NDevil Fruit I've ever heard of!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not claiming that I know\Nmuch about these seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But if this guy's power is kitten\Nhands, what are we worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed, Cyborg Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the extent of your power,\Nyou should keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.42,0:20:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps he's deflecting\Nthe air itself a normal
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,physical attack wouldn't have\Naffected Franky like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I Call it the pad cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:21:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply deflect to air\Npressure at light speed and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,it creates a shockwave that\Ncan pierce through anything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.62,0:21:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel my thrust pad cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Streaming wolf swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He can even repel his swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle he's gone this\Nlong in the condition he's in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw the beating he took from Ores!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If this guy lays a finger\Non him, he's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.21,0:22:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's as far as you'll get!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Konkase!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.98,0:22:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't have a chance\Nto deflect his kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His skull's gonna be a thousand pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, I said not to butt in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it you're a black leg, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:22:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected more from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He kicked him in the face\Nand he didn't even flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This just keeps getting worse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.20,0:23:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is his face made of steel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That kick should have busted in his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go now, Phoenix Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Sniper steps to the place,\Na title you clearly gave yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew from the start\Nthat killing a crew of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,injured weaklings like you\Nwould bring me new joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.42,0:23:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that it's not a fair\Nfight, but orders are orders, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,if I may not fully agree with them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,what the hell is
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.96,0:23:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he doing is that air
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.24,0:24:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like a giant bubble shaped\Nlike a paw and he keeps making it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Smaller, I think I know what he's\Ndoing. He's using his power to deflect a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.22,0:24:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,giant air mass but he's compressing\Nit into a tiny ball. The real attack
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.20,0:24:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,will come as soon as he releases all\Nof that compressed pressure that much
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.32,0:24:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,air it'll send out a massive shock
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,wave like an enormous bomb did I hear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.46,0:24:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you right like a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,bomb you mean he's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna release that and blow us all?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.90,0:24:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.74,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought it over,\Nand I've made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will spare your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.72,0:24:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But on one condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.90,0:24:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for this act of magnanimity,\Nyou give me the head of Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I return with him, That should\Nbe enough to satisfy the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't betray our own captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.10,0:25:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.62,0:25:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This was your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.06,0:26:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lines on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.66,0:27:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a cyborg like Franky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.26,0:27:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, but made of\Nsomething tougher than he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.14,0:27:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A cyborg?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.70,0:27:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But my metal parts are all I have\Nin common with your friend, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.48,0:28:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a creation known as a pacifista,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,an in-development human weapons\Nproject of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.60,0:28:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A pacifist?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.76,0:28:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I was created by the government's\Nmost renowned scientist, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegabuck, one of the greatest\Ngeniuses this world has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,To put that into perspective,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.08,0:28:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,his discoveries are so\Nsophisticated that it's believed it
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,will take the rest of the world\N500 years to catch up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.36,0:28:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Technology that advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.62,0:28:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And you have Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.82,0:28:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.86,0:28:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You have an advantage over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.52,0:28:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well this is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.02,0:28:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't listen to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way you'll back down
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.40,0:28:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is if we give you Luffy's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.28,0:28:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the only compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.90,0:28:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.00,0:29:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a head? Then\NI'll give you a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.42,0:29:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I can't give you my captain's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.52,0:29:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to take mine instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.56,0:29:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please settle for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not have the same bounty on\Nmy head as Luffy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.40,0:29:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I swear to you that\NI am destined to become
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest swordsman\Nthe world has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.90,0:29:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely that must be worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You possess that much ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.42,0:29:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet you're willing to give it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and exchange your life for his?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.74,0:29:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The way things are looking, I don't see\Nany other way to save the rest of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.14,0:29:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of having ambition\Nif I can't even save my captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.34,0:29:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is the man who'll\Nbecome king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.44,0:29:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're real cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.20,0:29:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to show me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.98,0:29:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You got the right idea,\Nbut what about your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.46,0:30:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't accomplish anything if\Nyou're dead, you stubborn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.36,0:30:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you giant oaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.32,0:30:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't bother with Mosshead here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're taking a head, take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.34,0:30:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The government might not consider\Nme a serious threat right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll regret not taking my head\Nover his once I start making trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.44,0:30:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance to\Ntake on Blackleg Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.04,0:30:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The only head you're taking is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.06,0:30:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about these fools!\NGet out of here. Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.94,0:30:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just as ready to\Nsacrifice myself as he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.10,0:30:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I fed people my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.32,0:30:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll feed the worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.78,0:30:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.10,0:30:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone I'm sorry\NI couldn't say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.10,0:31:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to put you guys out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.28,0:31:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like you'll\Nhave to find a new cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosshead, you son of
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.04,0:31:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show me you've got some honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.06,0:31:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made sure I can't\Neven touch Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.62,0:31:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not unless I want to shame myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.64,0:31:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you've got my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.50,0:31:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want,\NI give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.14,0:31:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take Straw Hat's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.46,0:32:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're intent on taking his place,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.32,0:32:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you will experience a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've just repelled all physical injury\Nfrom Straw Hat's body. His exhaustion,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.36,0:32:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,his pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.76,0:32:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What rests before you is the sum total of
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,anguish he endured during\Nhis battle with Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.16,0:32:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly wish to take his place,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.32,0:32:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,then you must accept and\Ninflict his agony upon yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.12,0:32:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As close to death as you are already,\Nnot only will it undoubtedly kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.90,0:32:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it will do so painfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.28,0:32:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have a taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.16,0:33:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me pick the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.38,0:33:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't be anyone's son\Nbut yours, could he, Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.26,0:33:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is everyone still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.52,0:33:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.44,0:33:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have just assumed we were all dead\Nafter that explosion and left the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.06,0:33:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that we won!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.70,0:33:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid bombing! This hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.06,0:34:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, you gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you bouncing around like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.12,0:34:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.78,0:34:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My body feels as good as new!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.44,0:34:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why! Quit lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.50,0:34:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down before you hurt yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.26,0:34:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible he took so much damage\Nto the brain it knocked him silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.48,0:34:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way that guy just let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.72,0:34:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Saru, what'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.94,0:34:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.88,0:34:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It really freaked me out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.78,0:34:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happened to the warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.34,0:34:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did all\Nthis blood come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.04,0:34:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.36,0:34:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that paw guy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.28,0:34:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.88,0:34:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.06,0:35:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
